    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LARA: I don't believe it...\nLARA: I thought you two were off on pressing business somewhere?\nLADY VIVIAN: Lara, you didn't really think we'd miss your 16th birthday?\nLARA: Oh, is that today?",
      "LADY VIVIAN: Well I think we should break it in, don't you, Desmond?\nLARA: What are you saying, Mother?",
      "LADY VIVIAN: It's your choice, Lara.\nLARA: Everywhere you've been...I've dreamed of going.\nLARA: I want to ski Mount Annapurna. No one's ever skied there before.\nLADY VIVIAN: Lara, do you even know how to ski?",
      "EVELYN: Lara! I'm so glad you could make it. And look at you -- that vacation did you a world of good.\nLARA: It was a brilliant suggestion, Aunt Ev. May we speak alone for a moment?\nEVELYN: Yes, but only a moment. So many people to attend to, you know.\nLARA: I've signed the paperwork, as promised."
    ]
